        ▸ Quality benchmark — v1.0 launch baseline
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-text)]">
        <strong class="text-[color:var(--color-text-bright)]">Historical
        baseline (2026-05-08):</strong>{" "}
        the engine-selection rationale that put Surya into production for
        v1.0. For the current operated-answer choice (Sonnet 4.6) and the
        full model-by-model comparison see the
        <a href="#ocr-pipeline" class="text-[color:var(--color-signal-cyan)] underline decoration-[color:var(--color-border-bright)] hover:decoration-[color:var(--color-signal-cyan)]">
        VLM bake-off subsection</a> in the OCR pipeline section above.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-text)]">
        The v1.0 A/B benchmark below ran on a 5-PDF golden set covering
        engine failure modes: clean typewriter, faded FBI carbon, multi-
        column form, redacted page, long debriefing. Truth proxy via the
        LLM with explicit verbatim-transcription instructions; Tesseract
        and Surya were scored against that truth. Median CER is the
        headline metric because raw means are skewed by 1–2 hallucination
        outliers on near-blank pages.
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="font-mono text-[11px] w-full">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-[color:var(--color-border)]">
              <th class="text-left py-1 pr-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Engine</th>
              <th class="text-right py-1 px-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Mean conf</th>
              <th class="text-right py-1 px-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Median CER</th>
              <th class="text-right py-1 px-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Median WER</th>
              <th class="text-right py-1 px-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Per-page</th>
              <th class="text-right py-1 pl-3 text-[color:var(--color-text-faint)] uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">$ /page</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-[color:var(--color-border)]/40">
              <td class="py-1 pr-3 text-[color:var(--color-text)]">Tesseract</td>
              <td class="py-1 px-3 text-right text-[color:var(--color-text)]">77.1</td>
              <td class="py-1 px-3 text-right text-[color:var(--color-signal-amber)]">40.4%</td>
              <td class="py-1 px-3 text-right text-[color:var(--color-signal-amber)]">59.8%</td>
              <td class="py-1 px-3 text-right text-[color:var(--color-text)]">2.4s</td>
              <td class="py-1 pl-3 text-right text-[color:var(--color-text-dim)]">$0</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-[color:var(--color-border)]/40">
              <td class="py-1 pr-3 text-[color:var(--color-signal-green)] font-semibold">Surya</td>
